OL,4,CPROGRAMMES
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1984FThe first edition of the new
OL,7,Flook BBC early evening news programme
OL,8,Fairs on BBC One: Six o'Clock News. The
OL,9,Fnew programme is edited by Ron Neil.
OL,10,FSue Lawley and Nicholas Witchell (who
OL,11,Fmoved from the reporting staff to
OL,12,Fbecome a permanent member of the news
OL,13,Fpresenting team) present the first
OL,14,Fedition and would be the regular
OL,15,Fpresenters.
OL,16,
OL,17,FGeorge Fenton composed the new theme
OL,18,Ftune. Patrick Lunt - BBC Radio 2
OL,19,Fannouncer/news presenter - provided the
OL,20,Fopening voiceover, introducing the
OL,21,Fpresenters over the opening titles.
OL,22,
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
